      "slug": "why-octopus-blood-is-blue",
      "title": "章鱼为什么流“蓝色的血”？关键不是三颗心，而是铜",
      "verification_status": "verified",
      "core_facts": [
        {"fact": "头足类使用含铜的血蓝蛋白运输氧，氧合后血淋巴呈蓝色。", "status": "verified", "sources": ["Smithsonian Ocean", "The Biological Bulletin"]},
        {"fact": "章鱼有三颗心：两颗鳃心向鳃泵血，一颗体心向全身泵送富氧血。", "status": "verified", "sources": ["Smithsonian Ocean", "Monterey Bay Aquarium"]},
        {"fact": "血蓝蛋白氧结合性能受温度、pH、盐度和离子等环境变量影响。", "status": "verified", "sources": ["The Biological Bulletin", "Smithsonian Ocean"]}
      ],
